    "decision": "every inherited group is in training and in no other partition",
    "why": "Final A, final B and canary must be new relative to D1, and S21D2-024 refuses an inherited group in calibration, so training is the only partition that can hold them. It is also the only placement that keeps a task D1 already published out of every number D2 will report.",
