    "why_that_matters": "A C3 candidate id is uuid5 of the task id and the strategy, so it is a reversible encoding of the recipe. Reusing one would restore the D1 oracle through the identifier rather than through a feature. Inherited tasks enter under D2 opaque positional identity and the neutral recipe binding instead.",
    "d1_outcomes_read": 0,
